WEBVTT

01:29.530 --> 01:33.180
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.670 --> 01:36.259
[Episode 23]

01:46.500 --> 01:47.180
Everyone.

01:47.470 --> 01:48.110
Tonight

01:48.140 --> 01:50.860
is the annual
Lantern Festival death match.

01:50.979 --> 01:54.140
It is also my wedding
as the Master of Lingya Tower.

01:55.080 --> 01:56.200
And I hope

01:56.360 --> 01:59.039
this thrilling hunt of life and death

01:59.220 --> 02:01.620
will help celebrate such a grand occasion.

02:02.360 --> 02:04.220
Celebrate with all under heaven!

02:04.320 --> 02:06.380
Eternal Prosperity of Lingya Tower!

02:06.400 --> 02:07.920
Celebrate with all under heaven!

02:07.920 --> 02:09.600
Eternal Prosperity of Lingya Tower!

02:09.600 --> 02:10.840
Celebrate with all under heaven!

02:10.840 --> 02:12.280
Eternal Prosperity of Lingya Tower!

02:12.280 --> 02:13.650
Celebrate with all under heaven!

02:13.650 --> 02:15.030
Eternal Prosperity of Lingya Tower!

02:15.030 --> 02:17.800
This round of the death match
is called the Hunting Grounds.

02:17.800 --> 02:19.730
The female prisoners are the prey.

02:20.400 --> 02:22.600
One point for a hit with bow or crossbow.

02:22.640 --> 02:25.880
Two points for close-range injuries.

02:26.240 --> 02:29.200
Five points for taking a head.

02:29.480 --> 02:32.760
Whoever scores the highest by the end
will be crowned champion.

02:32.760 --> 02:35.520
And rest assured, everyone.

02:35.800 --> 02:39.000
All the prey have already
taken a muscle-weakening drug.

02:39.079 --> 02:41.010
They are completely defenseless.

02:41.030 --> 02:43.360
So enjoy the hunt to your heart's content!

02:43.720 --> 02:44.920
Where're my friends?

02:45.760 --> 02:47.020
They're already here.

02:50.550 --> 02:51.350
Ah!

02:52.060 --> 02:53.500
Dao. Tuya.

02:53.530 --> 02:54.530
Nan Yanzhi.

02:59.320 --> 03:00.280
Master!

03:00.560 --> 03:01.520
Yanzhi!

03:02.820 --> 03:04.420
Why are they down there?

03:07.380 --> 03:10.140
Yanzhi, I promised you

03:10.320 --> 03:11.520
I would not harm them.

03:12.360 --> 03:14.960
I said they would
appear alive at our wedding.

03:15.180 --> 03:18.500
But whether they survive
this round of the death match

03:19.160 --> 03:21.500
depends on their fate.

03:21.520 --> 03:22.640
You lied to me!

03:27.230 --> 03:30.000
From now on,
if our world holds only each other,

03:31.400 --> 03:32.730
that wouldn't be so bad.

03:36.130 --> 03:37.570
Despicable!

03:40.160 --> 03:44.480
Everyone, the grand annual
Lantern Festival death match,

03:44.480 --> 03:45.680
the Hunting Grounds,

03:46.320 --> 03:47.600
begins now!

04:00.170 --> 04:00.960
Master!

04:00.960 --> 04:02.800
Please be careful!

04:25.080 --> 04:26.120
What's going on?

04:26.600 --> 04:29.260
Weren't they given
the muscle-weakening drug?

04:31.350 --> 04:35.220
[Elite Academy]

04:39.760 --> 04:41.080
Officer Qin.

04:41.600 --> 04:43.060
And all of you...

04:43.600 --> 04:45.640
Bet you didn't expect this, Nan Yanzhi.

04:45.640 --> 04:48.640
The two of us have been
helping you in secret all along.

04:50.960 --> 04:52.720
On the night of the Lantern Festival,

04:52.720 --> 04:56.080
most of the tower's guards
will be gathered at the Hunting Grounds.

04:56.080 --> 04:59.440
That will be the perfect chance
to unlock the prison cells on every floor

04:59.440 --> 05:01.680
and lead everyone out of Lingya Tower.

05:01.720 --> 05:03.440
Every year, the muscle-weakening drug
given to the female prisoners

05:03.440 --> 05:04.890
is prepared by me.

05:05.050 --> 05:06.160
And this year is no exception.

05:06.160 --> 05:08.400
Once chaos erupts in the Hunting Grounds,

05:08.400 --> 05:09.760
we'll coordinate with you.

05:09.760 --> 05:10.800
We'll open the cells on every floor

05:10.800 --> 05:11.890
and release all the female prisoners.

05:11.890 --> 05:14.400
By then, our people
will disguise themselves as nobles

05:14.400 --> 05:15.560
and slip into the crowd.

05:15.560 --> 05:17.210
With our forces working inside and out,

05:17.210 --> 05:18.990
we'll definitely succeed in one strike.

05:18.990 --> 05:19.710
Mm.

05:26.020 --> 05:26.820
Nan Yanzhi.

05:28.800 --> 05:29.790
Nan Yanzhi.

05:31.360 --> 05:32.490
You're still alive!

05:33.600 --> 05:34.800
Keep your voice down.

05:35.700 --> 05:36.840
This is my master.

05:40.700 --> 05:41.850
Master?

05:41.920 --> 05:43.050
I owe you an apology.

05:43.100 --> 05:46.159
For the sake of the plan,
I had to hide my identity.

05:46.230 --> 05:47.230
So it was you.

05:48.560 --> 05:49.200
Dao.

05:49.260 --> 05:50.050
Tuya.

05:50.520 --> 05:51.320
Jiang Man?

05:53.960 --> 05:54.980
What are you doing here?

05:54.980 --> 05:56.290
Earlier, when Man broke the bowl,

05:56.290 --> 05:58.000
I was the one who told her to do it.

05:58.000 --> 05:59.650
Sorry for not telling you beforehand.

05:59.650 --> 06:00.980
You actually lied to us.

06:04.640 --> 06:05.920
I knew it.

06:07.250 --> 06:08.800
There's no way you were smart enough

06:08.800 --> 06:10.330
to betray us all of a sudden.

06:12.280 --> 06:13.560
This time,

06:13.730 --> 06:15.080
we're not only here to save you.

06:15.080 --> 06:16.500
We're here to save everyone.

06:16.500 --> 06:17.060
Mm.

06:17.280 --> 06:18.680
Once the death match begins,

06:18.680 --> 06:21.040
the three of you lead everyone out.

06:21.060 --> 06:22.120
What about you two?

06:22.800 --> 06:24.660
I'm going to destroy Lingya Tower

06:25.000 --> 06:27.060
and wipe out these monsters for good.

06:27.180 --> 06:28.140
Count me in.

06:28.400 --> 06:29.360
But if you stay,

06:29.480 --> 06:31.220
you'll be facing a perilous battle.

06:31.220 --> 06:32.580
The warriors of my tribe

06:32.760 --> 06:34.040
do not retreat.

06:34.330 --> 06:36.110
And we would never abandon our comrades.

06:36.110 --> 06:37.440
I'm not leaving either.

06:37.620 --> 06:38.740
If I ran away now,

06:38.840 --> 06:41.440
I probably wouldn't sleep peacefully
for the rest of my life.

06:41.440 --> 06:43.740
Anyway, we either live together

06:43.840 --> 06:44.960
or die together.

06:44.980 --> 06:45.780
Mm.

06:46.360 --> 06:48.720
I'll fight alongside Yanzhi too.

06:50.400 --> 06:51.440
In that case,

06:52.720 --> 06:55.680
then we live and die together.

06:55.720 --> 06:57.320
Fight through death to live.

07:02.920 --> 07:04.160
Live and die together!

07:04.160 --> 07:05.760
Fight through death to live!

07:07.290 --> 07:08.170
Everyone!

07:08.980 --> 07:11.120
The time for revenge has come!

07:12.800 --> 07:16.910
Kill!

07:20.020 --> 07:20.990
Archers, fire!

08:30.570 --> 08:31.380
Go, now!

08:37.679 --> 08:38.640
Hurry!

08:39.530 --> 08:40.169
This way!

09:10.490 --> 09:14.680
Kill!

09:17.280 --> 09:18.210
Prime Minister!

09:18.560 --> 09:19.490
Prime Minister!

09:19.920 --> 09:20.740
Prime Minister!

09:20.740 --> 09:23.470
The female prisoners
in the tower have revolted!

09:23.600 --> 09:26.000
Quick! Notify the nearby
prefectures at once!

09:26.000 --> 09:27.920
Tell them to send
reinforcements immediately!

09:27.920 --> 09:28.600
Yes, Sir!

09:28.600 --> 09:30.040
Master, over here!

09:53.250 --> 09:54.580
Kill!

10:10.680 --> 10:11.650
Go after Prime Minister Lin.

10:11.650 --> 10:12.640
Leave him to me.

10:24.200 --> 10:25.120
Nan Yanzhi,

10:26.280 --> 10:27.940
why are you still so stubborn?

10:28.640 --> 10:30.300
I'll give you one last chance.

10:30.640 --> 10:32.400
Come back to my side right now.

10:32.440 --> 10:34.640
You're just as rotten as Lingya Tower now.

10:34.640 --> 10:35.980
Even if I die,

10:36.680 --> 10:38.320
I will never be with you.

10:39.160 --> 10:40.800
Nan Yanzhi!

11:21.290 --> 11:25.730
Kill!

11:29.170 --> 11:32.410
Kill!

11:51.860 --> 11:52.890
Zhuang Wujiu.

11:54.020 --> 11:55.300
Spare my life,

11:56.450 --> 11:58.600
and I can erase your criminal status.

11:58.800 --> 12:02.140
I can even grant you
a position of honor and prestige.

12:02.530 --> 12:05.520
Then you'll be admired
by all under heaven.

12:05.540 --> 12:06.620
Ha!

12:07.240 --> 12:09.040
What good is fine silk and glory?

12:09.230 --> 12:10.830
What good is endless wealth?

12:11.000 --> 12:13.390
None of it can erase
the pain I've endured all my life.

12:13.390 --> 12:15.920
None of it can cover up
the filth of this world.

12:17.400 --> 12:19.200
Then what is it you want?

12:20.350 --> 12:22.080
As long as it's within my power,

12:23.000 --> 12:24.740
I'll give it to you.

12:24.960 --> 12:27.620
For all the suffering
and injustice we endured,

12:28.000 --> 12:30.120
even if I'm torn to pieces...

12:35.560 --> 12:38.600
I'll make you pay in blood!

13:03.770 --> 13:04.650
Hyah!

13:06.410 --> 13:07.410
Hyah!

13:34.040 --> 13:38.810
♪ Frost still lights the old road,
while hatred traps my disciple ♪

13:40.550 --> 13:45.870
♪ Back then, you reached for me
with tears in your eyes ♪

13:47.570 --> 13:53.560
♪ I wiped your tears away
and carried your future on my shoulders ♪

13:54.870 --> 14:01.190
♪ I'd trade half my life
just to see you safe ♪

14:02.380 --> 14:05.050
♪ Your kindness is carved into my heart,
so I dared to challenge fate ♪

14:06.140 --> 14:08.680
♪ In this cruel world,
you were my only warmth ♪

14:09.700 --> 14:11.880
♪ You taught me to wield my sword through
the fog and led me out of darkness ♪

14:12.680 --> 14:15.730
♪ You showed me
that loyalty outweighs life itself ♪

14:19.540 --> 14:22.840
♪ Ours is a bond of souls,
and the greatest gift of all ♪

14:21.000 --> 14:22.120
Master,

14:22.120 --> 14:24.260
when will you start teaching me?

14:23.900 --> 14:26.390
♪ I once swore to protect you
until you found freedom ♪

14:24.520 --> 14:26.740
When did I ever agree
to take you as my disciple?

14:26.740 --> 14:29.440
Master, please teach me
the strongest martial arts!

14:27.280 --> 14:30.050
♪ Though my sins can never be repaid,
I still tend your wounds ♪

14:29.480 --> 14:31.780
I want to avenge my parents!

14:30.970 --> 14:33.770
♪ I only pray Heaven
never leaves you alone again ♪

14:31.800 --> 14:33.330
I made this for you, Master.

14:33.350 --> 14:36.430
I named it the filigree bangle.

14:34.610 --> 14:37.290
♪ Now that revenge is won,
my heart feels emptier than ever ♪

14:36.760 --> 14:38.920
One day, when you wear it,

14:38.220 --> 14:40.770
♪ What I fear most is you
sacrificing yourself for me in the end ♪

14:38.950 --> 14:40.920
if we charge into Lingya Tower together,

14:40.920 --> 14:42.000
nothing will stand in our way.

14:41.610 --> 14:44.370
♪ Even if fate leaves us no road ahead ♪

14:42.000 --> 14:43.260
We'll be unstoppable.

14:45.240 --> 14:49.710
♪ I still wish to face
this doomed path by your side ♪

15:05.530 --> 15:08.550
♪ The wind cuts like blades,
the night feels like a grave ♪

15:06.910 --> 15:09.210
Why didn't you kill me back then?

15:09.320 --> 15:10.600
Why?

15:09.360 --> 15:12.350
♪ Together we walked
through blood and chaos ♪

15:13.560 --> 15:15.580
♪ Our hearts bound as one,
our fates intertwined ♪

15:16.600 --> 15:20.260
♪ Our vow was carved deep into our palms ♪

15:21.690 --> 15:24.730
♪ If not for you, how could I
stand tall within the flames? ♪

15:24.920 --> 15:25.950
Other than you,

15:25.590 --> 15:28.360
♪ Without your protection,
I'd never have made it this far ♪

15:27.310 --> 15:29.060
I have nothing left to hold onto.

15:29.060 --> 15:31.720
[Virtue and Merit in Equal Splendor]

15:29.180 --> 15:32.070
♪ The one who escaped the prison,
the one who forged the sword ♪

15:33.080 --> 15:35.440
♪ Together we walked
through blades and fire as one ♪

15:35.940 --> 15:37.690
You don't have to hesitate
because of me anymore.

15:37.690 --> 15:40.430
♪ Falling into the snow ♪

15:37.900 --> 15:39.560
Stop carrying everything alone.

15:39.560 --> 15:41.660
I want to fight by your side.

15:42.060 --> 15:45.860
♪ Your eyes reflect our final farewell ♪

15:42.430 --> 15:43.250
For my parents,

15:43.250 --> 15:44.090
and for you,

15:44.520 --> 15:47.000
let's make them repay every debt they owe.

15:47.000 --> 15:48.700
If Lingya Tower didn't
exist in this world,

15:48.700 --> 15:53.330
♪ Master, stay awake.
I still want to hear my name from you ♪

15:48.830 --> 15:51.990
I really would like
to stay here with you forever.

15:52.400 --> 15:53.400
Then tonight,

15:53.420 --> 15:54.640
let's pretend

15:55.070 --> 15:56.760
that none of this exists.

15:55.620 --> 16:00.880
♪ Don’t cry, disciple.
I'd protect you through every lifetime ♪

15:57.130 --> 15:58.210
No tower.

15:58.320 --> 15:59.720
No cages.

16:00.160 --> 16:01.590
Only wine.

16:01.660 --> 16:04.700
♪ Only now do I understand ♪

16:05.240 --> 16:06.600
Only you and me.

16:05.660 --> 16:08.500
♪ The hottest, deepest, fiercest feeling ♪

16:09.420 --> 16:12.900
♪ Is this very moment ♪

16:17.480 --> 16:20.240
♪ This life is enough.
This life is enough ♪

16:21.090 --> 16:23.360
♪ It began with passion and ended in joy ♪

16:24.340 --> 16:27.110
♪ May we still protect each other
as master and disciple in the next life ♪

16:28.300 --> 16:31.110
♪ And walk together to the end
of the road we never finished ♪

16:30.960 --> 16:31.920
Master...

16:33.000 --> 16:37.770
♪ Snow buries our names ♪

16:33.230 --> 16:34.450
They

16:35.350 --> 16:36.950
came to save us.

16:39.710 --> 16:43.630
♪ May the wind remember their brave ♪

16:43.700 --> 16:44.800
Nan Yanzhi!

16:44.880 --> 16:45.420
Yanzhi!

16:45.190 --> 16:49.890
♪ Silhouettes ♪

16:45.450 --> 16:46.180
Miss Zhuang!

16:46.900 --> 16:47.370
Yanzhi!

16:47.380 --> 16:48.110
Miss Zhuang!

16:48.130 --> 16:48.770
Miss Zhuang!

16:48.770 --> 16:49.500
Nan Yanzhi!

16:49.960 --> 16:50.970
-Nan Yanzhi!
-Zhuang Wujiu!

16:50.970 --> 16:51.770
Zhuang Wujiu!

16:53.840 --> 16:55.980
You fulfilled the promise
you made to everyone.

16:55.980 --> 16:57.950
I won't let anything happen to you.

16:58.660 --> 16:59.850
We succeeded.

17:00.440 --> 17:01.720
Yes, Yanzhi.

17:02.000 --> 17:02.960
Look!

17:02.980 --> 17:04.849
Everyone escaped from Lingya Tower!
